# VHS tape for claudemd-doctor's README demo GIF.
# Install VHS: https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
# Render: vhs docs/demo.tape  (needs ttyd + ffmpeg on PATH)
#
# Run from the repository root. Uses `npm run demo`, which builds and runs
# the CLI against the synthetic fixture under demo/home (--home demo/home
# --cwd D:\demo-project) — never anything from the machine recording it.

Output docs/assets/demo.gif

Set Theme "Dracula"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 650
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "npm run demo"
Enter
Sleep 9500ms
